237	  <footer>
238	    <p>Model: norethindrone with first-order absorption; F = 0.65 from the label, other parameters fitted to the label's single-dose values (time to peak, peak, 24-hour average, 24-hour level, half-life). Curves are exact solutions, and late-pill scenarios add up single-dose curves.</p>
239	    <p>An educational model built for a course project, not medical advice. Hormone level stands in for protection here; the minipill also works by thickening cervical mucus, which the model doesn't simulate.</p>
