rep("""Pills on time until day 15; that pill is taken late (later pills stay on their usual time) or skipped. CDC treats a minipill more than 3 h late as missed, but a combined pill needs no backup until 48 h.</p>""",
    """Pills on time until day 15; that pill is taken late (later pills stay on their usual time), skipped, or two pills are missed (the missed pill and the next one then taken together at +48 h, as CDC advises). CDC treats a minipill more than 3 h late as missed, but a combined pill needs no backup until 48 h.</p>""")
